Cc: Jacob Pan <jacob.jun.pan@linux.intel.com>
Cc: Peter Xu <peterx@redhat.com>
Cc: Eric Auger <eric.auger@redhat.com>
Cc: Yi Sun <yi.y.sun@linux.intel.com>
